<DIV align="left" style="margin-left: 0%; margin-right: 0%; text-indent: 4%; font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times; color: #000000; background: #FFFFFF">
    We expect that a portion of our portfolio of real property
    investments will be comprised of properties with industrial
    tenants. The leases for these industrial tenants are expected to
    be short-term, ranging from one to 15&#160;year terms. We may
    have difficulty obtaining a new tenant upon the expiration of
