<DIV align="left" style="margin-left: 0%; margin-right: 0%; text-indent: 4%; font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times; color: #000000; background: #FFFFFF">
    We believe that industrial warehouse assets offer investors
    above-average capitalization rates and
    <FONT style="white-space: nowrap">above-average</FONT>
