    <FONT style="white-space: nowrap">SFAS&#160;157-4.</FONT>
    Generally, changes in the fair value of
    <FONT style="white-space: nowrap">available-for-sale</FONT>
    investments will not affect reported earnings or cash flows, but
    will impact stockholders&#146; equity and, accordingly, book
    value per share. Upon the sale of an investment, we will reverse
