    has the authority under our organizational documents, to the
    extent permitted by Maryland law, to pay distributions from any
    source, including proceeds from this offering or the proceeds
    from the issuance of securities in the future.
</DIV>

<DIV style="margin-top: 6pt; font-size: 1pt">&nbsp;</DIV>

<DIV align="left" style="margin-left: 0%; margin-right: 0%; text-indent: 4%; font-size: 10pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times; color: #000000; background: #FFFFFF">
